senses.gloss:
--a price for marriage; कृष्ण was not prepared to pay any price for सत्या;
1: भा. X. ५८. ४०.
one selling a daughter to be punished;
2: M. २२७. २०.
a tax gathered by kings of Kali age.
3: Vi. VI. 1. ३४.

--शूलपाणि, शूलधर, शूलि, शिव: living in the city of बाण;
1: Br. II. १३. ६२; M. 6. १३.
lord of different classes of spirits;
2: Ib. 8. 5.
blessed Yama son of विवस्वान् to be a लोकपाल and Lord of पितृस्;
3: Ib. ११. १९.
married दाक्षायणी and was not invited to दक्ष's sacrifice;
4: Ib. १३. १३.
with १८ hands, residing at Gomati;
5: Ib. २२. १३.
acted as Protector for Soma's राजसूय.
6: Ib. २३. १९; २५२. 5.
